`task-board validate` reports one `PARENT_STATUS_MISMATCH`: parent story `STORY-260715-2wjwuf` remains `backlog` while this explicitly assigned child is in `development`. The validation process itself exits 0. A scoped attempt to set the story to `development` also exited 0 at the process level but returned `ok:false` because sibling story `STORY-260715-1y04r0` has unfinished dependencies. No board files were edited directly; the anomaly is recorded here for routing.

